<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1">
<title>Registration Closed — Navchetna Yuva Shakti Mahotsav 2026</title>

<style>
  :root{
    /* ---- Design tokens : "Navchetna" — night mela, marigold + gulal ---- */
    --ink:         #1B1030;
    --ink-2:       #2A1B49;
    --marigold:    #FFA630;
    --marigold-2:  #FFC15E;
    --gulal:       #E63E7C;
    --gulal-2:     #FF6FA5;
    --cream:       #FFF8ED;
    --cream-2:     #FFEFD6;
    --ok:          #2E9E6B;
    --err:         #E5484D;
    --line:        rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
    --shadow:      0 20px 50px -20px rgba(15,5,35,0.55);

    --font-display: 'Baloo 2', 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    --font-body:    'Inter', sans-serif;
    --font-deva:    'Noto Sans Devanagari', 'Inter', sans-serif;

    --radius: 18px;
    --radius-sm: 12px;
  }

  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Baloo+2:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Noto+Sans+Devanagari:wght@500;600;700&display=swap');

  *{ box-sizing:border-box; }
  html,body{ margin:0; padding:0; }

  #nysm-root{
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 15% 0%, rgba(255,166,48,0.18), transparent 45%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 15%, rgba(230,62,124,0.20), transparent 40%),
      var(--ink);
    color: var(--cream);
    min-height:100vh;
    padding: 0 0 64px;
    line-height:1.5;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  #nysm-root *{ font-family: inherit; }
  #nysm-root .deva{ font-family: var(--font-deva); }

  .wrap{
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 18px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* ---------------- Header / hero ---------------- */
  .nysm-hero{
    position:relative;
    padding: 40px 18px 32px;
    text-align:center;
    overflow:hidden;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .nysm-hero::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; inset:-40% -10% auto -10%;
    height: 220px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--marigold) 0 3px, transparent 3px 26px);
    opacity:0.18;
    transform: rotate(-3deg);
  }
  .nysm-eyebrow{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color: #FF9AA6; font-weight:700;
    background: rgba(229, 72, 77, 0.12);
    border:1px solid rgba(229, 72, 77, 0.35);
    padding: 6px 14px; border-radius:999px;
    margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .nysm-title{
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight:800;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 7vw, 40px);
    margin:0 0 6px;
    background: linear-gradient(95deg, var(--marigold) 0%, var(--gulal-2) 65%, var(--gulal) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip:text; background-clip:text; color:transparent;
  }
  .nysm-subtitle{
    font-size:14px; color: rgba(255,248,237,0.72); margin:0;
    max-width: 480px; margin:0 auto;
  }

  /* ---------------- Cards / panels ---------------- */
  .nysm-panel{
    background: var(--cream);
    color: #241338;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 32px 24px;
    margin: 32px auto 18px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .nysm-status-icon{
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFE9F1, #FFF3E0);
    border: 2px dashed var(--gulal);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 28px;
    margin: 0 auto 16px;
  }

  .nysm-panel h2{
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 24px;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: #1B1030;
  }

  .nysm-panel p{
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: #55446c;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .nysm-notice-box{
    background: #FFF3E0;
    border: 1.5px dashed var(--marigold);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 16px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: #5a3809;
    text-align: left;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .nysm-notice-box b{ color: #1B1030; }

  .nysm-actions{
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .nysm-btn{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px;
    width:100%; padding:14px 18px; border:none; border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight:700; font-size:15.5px;
    cursor:pointer; text-decoration:none; transition: transform .12s ease, opacity .12s ease;
  }
  .nysm-btn:active{ transform: scale(0.98); }
  .nysm-btn-primary{
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--marigold), var(--gulal));
    color:#fff; box-shadow: 0 10px 24px -8px rgba(230,62,124,0.55);
  }
  .nysm-btn-ghost{
    background:transparent; color:#5b4a72; border:1.5px solid #E4D9CC;
  }
  .nysm-btn-ghost:hover{
    background: #fdf6ec;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="nysm-root">
  <div class="nysm-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="nysm-eyebrow">✦ Registrations Closed · 2026 ✦</span>
      <h1 class="nysm-title deva">नवचेतना युवा शक्ति महोत्सव</h1>
      <p class="nysm-subtitle">Youth, Culture & Competition Celebration</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="nysm-panel">
      <div class="nysm-status-icon">⛔</div>
      <h2 class="deva">पंजीकरण अब बंद हो चुका है</h2>
      <p>
        Online registrations for <strong>Navchetna Yuva Shakti Mahotsav 2026</strong> have officially closed as we have reached capacity for the competitive events.
      </p>

      <div class="nysm-notice-box">
        <div style="font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;">Important Instructions for Registered Participants:</div>
        <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;">
          <li>If you already registered, please make sure to keep a printed copy or digital screenshot of your ticket pass.</li>
          <li>Carry an authentic <b>College/School Photo ID</b> to the venue on the day of the event.</li>
          <li>Reach the event arena 30 minutes before your respective category slot starts.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="nysm-actions">
        <a href="/" class="nysm-btn nysm-btn-primary">← Go to Event Home</a>
        <a href="tel:+910000000000" class="nysm-btn nysm-btn-ghost">Need Help? Contact Helpdesk</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
